artifacts/

# OS / Editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# Task worktrees (managed by Orchestrator, not for direct edit)
.worktrees/

# Inbox is per-task ephemeral; archive what matters
.dev/inbox/

# Local data / reports cache
data/**/raw_cache/
reports/calibration/*/raw_runs/
.dev/integration_tests/reports/*/raw/
# Backtest tennis cassettes (regenerated by tennis_fetcher; never committed — see plan D3)
agent/backtest/_cache_tennis/
# Precomputed signal-row cache for the cached config sweep (regenerated; large)
reports/backtest/_*.json
# L5 survival-journey export (regenerated by `python -m agent.backtest.survival_season run`;
# the full-universe journey carries 3x4925-pt baselines = large). A deliberately
# down-sampled, version-pinned artifact for the dashboard may be force-added later.
dashboard/public/backtest/survival_journey.json
# L5 survival-journey AI run export (regenerated by `run --with-ai`; large
# regenerated artifact like its numerical sibling above).
dashboard/public/backtest/survival_journey_ai.json
# Preserved PRE-REALISM-RULES run snapshots (the "finetune process" exhibits —
# kept on disk + deployed via the vercel CLI upload, never in git; same size
# rationale as their live siblings above).
dashboard/public/backtest/survival_journey_run*.json
dashboard/public/backtest/survival_journey_ai_run*.json
# Provider-comparison leg (Gemini-only full run; same rationale).
dashboard/public/backtest/survival_journey_ai_gemini.json
dashboard/public/backtest/survival_journey_ai_gemini_run*.json

# Build / temp
tmp/
*.tmp
*.log
*.bak

# Test artifacts that aren't meant to be checked in
playwright-report/
test-results/
screenshots-temp/
reports/backtest/_ai_state/

# --- Clean re-init 2026-06-11: exclude dev-harness internals (PII/secret/log source) ---
.dev/
.claude/
logs/
reports/
.worktrees/
.git_old_backup/
dashboard/screenshots/

# --- Hardened never-commit guards (keep this repo permanently clean) ---
# Secrets / credentials — broaden beyond the basics above. .env stays blocked
# by the `Secrets` block; these catch the common extra shapes.
.env.local
.env.*.local
*.env
!*.env.example
!.env.example
*.pfx
*.crt
*.cer
*.der
*.keystore
*.jks
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
*.ppk
.netrc
.npmrc
.pypirc
.aws/
.gcloud/
gha-creds-*.json
service-account*.json
*service_account*.json
*.credentials.json
*credentials*.json
!*.credentials.example.json

# Agent / LLM session transcripts + audit trails — THE leak vector that put a
# Gemini key + a personal email into git before. Block them wherever they land,
# not just under .dev/.
**/track_agent_events*.jsonl
**/*session*.jsonl
**/agent_transcript*.jsonl
**/.transcripts/

# Vercel / deploy CLI link (project + org ids; Vercel itself says don't commit)
.vercel/
**/.vercel/

# AI-coding tool local state (can cache file contents incl. secrets)
.aider*
.cursor/
.continue/
.history/
.codeium/

# Misc local databases / dumps that can hold real data
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db
*.dump

# OS/editor strays not already covered
*.orig
.env.bak
dashboard/public/backtest/reincarnation*.json
